'''Empty gourd vial''' are obtained from picking [[gourd tree]]s found in resource rooms within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. They must then be filled with water, by using them on [[Geyser|geysers]], to create a [[water-filled gourd vial]], which is used to make potions within the Chambers.

